#letter \x2021 23578 #Double dagger (0x87
sign \x2022 45-3 #Bullit (0x95)
noback sign \x2023 45-3 #Triangular bullit
noback punctuation \x2026 3-3-3 #Elipsis (0x85)
noback space \x202f 0 # Narrow No-Break Space (NNBSP)
